    <!-- Guide / Help Content -->
    <string name="guide_content">
Umkhokelo wesinyathelo ngesinyathelo\n
1. Khetha umfanekiso weprofayile ocacileyo nowobungcali\n
-Sebenzisa umfanekiso ocacileyo okanye ilogo yobungcali.\n
-Qinisekisa ukuba umfanekiso ukhanya kakuhle kwaye ubuso bubonakala.\n
-Gwema imifanekiso engacacanga okanye ephantsi kwesisombululo.\n
\n
2. Bhala isihloko esinamandla\n
-Sifutshane, sichaza, kwaye sigxininisa isakhono sakho esiphambili.\n
Umzekelo: “Umzobi weGraphic | Izisombululo zeLogo kunye neBranding”\n
Iingcebiso:\n
-Gxila kubungcali kunye nokucaca.\n
-Sebenzisa amagama aphambili abantu abanokuwakhangela.\n
-Yiba nyanisekile ngezakhono zakho kunye nexesha lokuhanjiswa komsebenzi.
    </string>
